    "pi v1.5.2: each Linux tarball's SHA-256 equals its line in the release's SHA256SUMS and the digest GitHub recorded at upload, its size equals GitHub's, and its pi/package.json says 1.5.2; it holds only regular files and directories under pi/, whose count and bytes are pinned for the unpacker",
